WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:03.360
Hello guys and welcome back to yeagerists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.600
in today's video we will be going&nbsp;
through the story of Grisha Yeager.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.640
Leave a like on this video and subscribe to our&nbsp;
channel if you want to see more content like this!

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:20.640
Grisha was born in Liberio in the year&nbsp;
806 on the continent of Marley. One day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:26.160
he and his sister ran out of the internment zone&nbsp;
chasing after an airship and were found out by two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:31.600
Public Security Authorities officers. One of the&nbsp;
men punished Grisha while the other one took Faye&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:37.760
away. After the officer finished beating him, he&nbsp;
allowed Grisha to continue watching the airship,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:42.320
stating since Grisha had already trespassed,&nbsp;
they might as well continue watching the airship.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:49.520
However, when Grisha returned home. Faye was not&nbsp;
there. Her corpse was later found mangled in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:55.200
river. The Marleyan officers visited the family&nbsp;
home and explained that Faye and Grisha were at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:00.880
fault for leaving and denied any knowledge of&nbsp;
her death. As Mrs. Yeager was filled with tears,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:06.880
Mr. Yeager smiled and explained that he would&nbsp;
re-inform his son of their history. He then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:12.080
explained the history of the Eldians and why their&nbsp;
ancestors' actions justify their outcast status&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:18.160
in Marleyan society. However, Grisha explained&nbsp;
that he believed the Marley men were lying and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:22.720
tried to say they killed his sister but Mr.&nbsp;
Yeager silenced him and the two fought over their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:28.640
situation as Eldians. Mr. Yeager tried to convince&nbsp;
his son why they needed to be punished but Grisha&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:33.120
expressed his belief that they should not have&nbsp;
to pay for the actions their ancestors committed.&nbsp;

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:38.480
Grisha continued to live his life being shamed for&nbsp;
being an Eldian and eventually became a doctor.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:44.320
The meeting with Grice, a patient, led Grisha to&nbsp;
learn about the circumstances of Faye's death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:48.560
This gave him the motivation to&nbsp;
join the Eldian Restorationists.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:53.440
Through his activities and a mole in&nbsp;
the Marley legal system named 'The Owl',&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:59.120
Grisha got information about Eldian history&nbsp;
and met Dina Fritz, a person of royal descent.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.880
A year later they got married and&nbsp;
had a child which they named Zeke.&nbsp;

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:08.800
Later in their lives, Marleyan officials recruited&nbsp;
children to take on the power of the seven Titans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:14.080
their people had stolen from the Eldians so many&nbsp;
years ago, so they could go to Paradis Island&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:18.880
and take down King Fritz, who had fled there&nbsp;
and built Walls for his people 80 years ago.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:24.640
"The Owl" informed the group that Marley’s&nbsp;
real goal was to steal the Founding Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:29.920
so they could enhance their military might.&nbsp;
Grisha then decided he would send his own son&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:35.120
into the program as a mole for them.
Over time, Grisha and Dina began coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:39.920
increasingly distant with Zeke, leaving him at&nbsp;
Grisha's parents' house almost every night so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:44.560
that they could attend meetings with the Eldian&nbsp;
Restorationists. Whenever he and Zeke had free&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:50.320
time, Grisha would spend it quizzing his son&nbsp;
on the "true" history of the Eldian race.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:55.520
In the meantime, Grisha also learned from Grice&nbsp;
that Zeke would need to earn higher marks as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:59.360
Warrior Candidate if he was to be involved&nbsp;
in the plan to recapture the Founding Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:03.840
causing Grisha to put even more&nbsp;
stress on Zeke to become a Warrior.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:10.080
However, after observing Zeke's poor performance&nbsp;
during a public training session, Grisha became&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.960
frustrated with his son, leading to a heated&nbsp;
argument with Dina about what to do with him.&nbsp;

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:21.920
One night during dinner, Zeke tried to convince&nbsp;
Grisha to stop helping the Eldian Restorationists.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:26.640
Grisha was appalled at the idea, reminding Zeke&nbsp;
that the only way for Eldians to live in peace&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:32.080
was for the restorationists to overthrow Marley.&nbsp;
He was enraged to hear Zeke bring up Faye,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:36.480
angrily telling him that the restorationists&nbsp;
were fighting with the express intent of making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.822
sure that no one suffered the same fate as her.&nbsp;
However, he was taken aback by Zeke's accusation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.822 --> 00:03:39.182
that Faye's death was caused by his decision to&nbsp;
take her outside of the internment zone. Stunned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.182 --> 00:03:39.520
by Zeke's words, Grisha lamented that he had&nbsp;
only wanted to see an airship with his sister.&nbsp;

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:44.640
At the age of seven, Zeke exposed his&nbsp;
parents and all the restorationists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.920
and they were sentenced to go to&nbsp;
Paradis Island as Pure Titans.&nbsp;

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:53.440
After being turned in to the Public Security&nbsp;
Authorities, Grisha was subjected to nude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:58.560
torture as the soldiers attempted to get him to&nbsp;
reveal who the Owl was by cutting off his fingers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:04.160
Once they gave up on obtaining the information,&nbsp;
Grisha and the rest of the restorationists were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:08.480
taken to Paradis Island and sat on their&nbsp;
knees before a large Wall by the ocean.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:14.800
After kicking Grice off the Wall alive, the rest&nbsp;
of the restorationists were turned into Titans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:20.400
with Titan injection except for the Yeagers&nbsp;
and another member. When it was Dina's turn,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:24.800
Grisha pleaded for her life, and tried to point&nbsp;
out that she was of royal descent and could be of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:29.760
potential use to them, but was silenced by Kruger&nbsp;
before any of the soldiers could overhear him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:35.280
to Grisha's surprise. He watched her transform&nbsp;
into a Titan and run after their friend, Grice.&nbsp;

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:40.080
Sergeant Major Gross decided&nbsp;
not to turn Grisha into a Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:43.760
but to throw him to the other restorationist&nbsp;
after he had been transformed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:49.200
After adjusting the dose to create a 3-4m class&nbsp;
and injecting the other man with injection,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:54.400
revealed to actually be Titan spinal fluid,&nbsp;
he threw him off the Wall to transform.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:59.280
He began explaining how watching people&nbsp;
be devoured made him feel alive in such&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:05.680
a dull society. He then began pushing Grisha off&nbsp;
asking him to fight and die in an interesting way.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:12.560
However, before he could do so, Kruger pushed&nbsp;
Gross off the Wall. As Gross is devoured,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:19.040
Kruger asked Grisha if he enjoyed such a sight.&nbsp;
He then revealed that he was The Owl and claimed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:24.160
that he would show Grisha how to truly use the&nbsp;
power of the Titans. Kruger then transformed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:27.920
into a Titan and destroyed the steamboat&nbsp;
that took all the soldiers to the island.&nbsp;

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:33.120
After destroying the Marleyan men and&nbsp;
their equipment, Kruger returned to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:37.840
the top of the Wall and, after introducing&nbsp;
himself and explaining how he became a spy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:44.480
he began to speak with Grisha who asked him&nbsp;
why he left only him alive. Kruger fell to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:49.600
his knees from exhaustion and told Grisha of his&nbsp;
terrible acts against several thousand Eldians,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:54.800
saying he did it all to serve Eldia in the end.&nbsp;
Kruger then said that he was entrusting Grisha&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:59.520
with his final mission, and went on to express&nbsp;
regret for playing a role in his sister’s death,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:04.400
but that the hatred he saw in Grisha's eyes the&nbsp;
next day was part of the reason he chose him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:09.600
This reminded Kruger of his own uprising, when&nbsp;
he watched his family be burned alive and chose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:14.240
to get revenge for them, however, it turned&nbsp;
out that he had to torture fellow Eldians to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:19.520
maintain his identity until that day. Kruger&nbsp;
told Grisha that he must enter the Walls and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:24.960
take back the Founding Titan, using the power&nbsp;
of the Titans Kruger would give him. Grisha then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:30.000
asked why Kruger was not doing it himself, but&nbsp;
Kruger explained that 13 years after inheriting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:35.040
the power of one of the Nine Titans, the host&nbsp;
would die, and it had been 13 years for him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:40.960
He then explained that all Eldians are connected&nbsp;
by paths to the Founding Titan Ymir Fritz once had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:46.000
and that no one can ever be stronger than&nbsp;
her, so they die after 13 years as she did.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:51.200
Grisha then questioned this logic and the Eldian&nbsp;
history, which Kruger explained is probably not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:57.200
true from the Marleyan or Eldian perspective.
When Grisha asked Kruger why he let the Marleyans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:02.480
turn Dina, he said that since Dina had royal&nbsp;
blood, it was too risky for her to remain;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:09.280
she had to go before Zeke could tell Marley more.&nbsp;
When Grisha objected, he asked Grisha if Dina&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:13.520
being forced to bear Marley's children for the&nbsp;
rest of her miserable life would have been better.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.920
Grisha told him that he did not believe he was&nbsp;
fit to take on his mission, and that he would not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:21.042
have paid the price for freedom if he knew what&nbsp;
it was. Kruger then commended Grisha's father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.042 --> 00:07:22.320
for trying to keep his family safe when he knew&nbsp;
what happened to Faye. Kruger confronted Grisha,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:27.760
and told him that the reason he chose him is that&nbsp;
at the expense of others, he sought freedom by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:32.800
going past the Walls. He said that their brothers&nbsp;
and sisters paid the price for their freedom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:39.360
and that those actions will follow them until they&nbsp;
are repaid, even after death. Grisha then stood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:44.400
up and accepted Kruger’s mission. He then told&nbsp;
him the name of the Titan he was going to take:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:51.680
the Attack Titan. After taking his power,&nbsp;
Grisha went to the Walls and began his mission.&nbsp;

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:57.360
Grisha was found wandering outside the Walls&nbsp;
near the Shiganshina District by Keith Shadis,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:02.000
a soldier of the Survey Corps. The&nbsp;
soldier was very surprised to see him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:06.480
not only because he was outside the Walls, but&nbsp;
also because he claimed to have suffered amnesia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:09.920
and he had no memories about the&nbsp;
civilization inside the Walls and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.201
military. Amazed to learn that the Eldians of&nbsp;
the Walls were attempting to fight the Titans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.201 --> 00:08:12.800
Grisha claimed to have amnesia.
Keith brought Grisha back to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:16.960
Shiganshina, where he was imprisoned&nbsp;
for illegally entering Titan territory.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:23.200
While imprisoned, he claimed to remember his&nbsp;
name. Upon release, Grisha revealed to Keith&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:28.320
that he "remembered" being a doctor, and asked him&nbsp;
for knowledge about the world inside the Walls.&nbsp;

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:32.800
Keith took Grisha to a pub in Shiganshina&nbsp;
where Keith taught him about the world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:37.760
Suitably impressed by the life that the Eldians&nbsp;
of the Walls had managed to build for themselves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:42.320
Grisha was surprised to hear that Keith was&nbsp;
unhappy with the state of the Walls, and had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:48.080
joined the Survey Corps in the hope of seeing the&nbsp;
larger world. Praising Keith and the Survey Corps,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:53.040
Grisha caught the attention of a nearby barmaid&nbsp;
named Carla, who began to chastise Keith for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:58.400
attempting to recruit more people to the Corps.&nbsp;
However, Grisha assured her that even if he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:03.040
offered the chance, he would not join them as the&nbsp;
Corps required special people to join its ranks.&nbsp;

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:07.840
Grisha eventually found work at a hospital.&nbsp;
When an epidemic broke out in Shiganshina,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:12.960
Grisha was able to successfully cure those&nbsp;
afflicted including Carla and her parents.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:18.800
Grisha and Carla eventually married each&nbsp;
other. At a party after the wedding ceremony,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:22.320
Grisha began to tell guests about&nbsp;
how Keith introduced him to Carla,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:28.640
before realizing that Keith had left the party&nbsp;
early. He and Carla would later have a son, Eren.&nbsp;

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:32.640
Grisha used his occupation as a doctor to get&nbsp;
close with government officials in order to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:36.000
gather information on the ruler of&nbsp;
the Walls and continue his mission&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:40.640
as a Restorationist. He eventually discovered&nbsp;
the location of the Reiss family's chapel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:45.200
as well as the hatch leading down to the&nbsp;
basement where the succession rituals take place.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:51.040
However, he chose to delay his mission&nbsp;
in favor of staying with his new family.&nbsp;

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:56.400
Years later, Grisha was making a&nbsp;
house call, with Eren tagging along,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.400 --> 00:10:00.240
to Mr. Ackerman and Mikasa's mother&nbsp;
for an appointed medical examination&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:06.880
in the year 844. When he arrived there,&nbsp;
he found them dead for hours. He asked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:11.600
Eren if he had seen the girl named Mikasa&nbsp;
anywhere, but he was too shocked to answer.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:18.080
He then told Eren to wait for him at the foot of&nbsp;
the mountain while he finds the Military Police.&nbsp;

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:23.200
After the MPs and Grisha arrived at the murderers'&nbsp;
hideout, Grisha hugged Eren and scolded him for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:27.680
the murders he committed when saving Mikasa,&nbsp;
asking if he even understood what he had done.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:34.160
However, instead of continuing to scold him&nbsp;
for killing Mikasa's kidnappers, he tells him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:40.400
that this time he was lucky and he could have been&nbsp;
killed himself. Mikasa, cold and depressed, asked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:45.840
Grisha in what direction her home was and stated&nbsp;
that she was cold and wants to leave. In response,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:50.000
Eren gave her his scarf and Grisha&nbsp;
told her to come live with them.&nbsp;

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:55.440
Despite not going through immediately with&nbsp;
his mission, Grisha felt that his family,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.440 --> 00:11:01.680
especially Eren, deserved to know the truth about&nbsp;
life outside the Walls. At night, Grisha would go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:05.920
into the Yeager family basement and write down&nbsp;
information about his former life in Marley.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:12.160
After compiling everything into three journals,&nbsp;
Grisha inscribed a message revealing that humanity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:16.560
was still alive beyond the walls on the back of&nbsp;
his old family's photograph and hid all of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:22.160
writings in his desk. He then locked the basement&nbsp;
door, keeping the key on him at all times.&nbsp;

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:26.160
Upon learning from Mikasa that Eren&nbsp;
wants to join the Survey Corps,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:30.720
Grisha is more obliging of the idea than Carla&nbsp;
and asks his son why he wants to leave the Walls.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:35.600
Eren's answer, that the deaths of the many&nbsp;
soldiers who have already served in the Survey&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:40.560
Corps will be a waste if no one continues the&nbsp;
fight, galvanizes Grisha to resume his mission to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:45.760
retake the Founding Titan from the Reiss family.&nbsp;
Grisha announces that he will be departing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:50.640
telling a bewildered Carla that there is no point&nbsp;
in trying to stop an inquisitive mind like Eren's.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:56.080
Before he leaves, he promises to show Eren what he&nbsp;
has been hiding in their basement when he returns.&nbsp;

00:11:56.880 --> 00:12:00.240
Grisha reflects on what he must do&nbsp;
the entire way to the Reiss chapel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:05.760
seeing through the future memories of the Attack&nbsp;
Titan that the day had come when Wall Maria would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:11.520
fall. Bursting in on the royal family, Grisha&nbsp;
reveals himself to be an Eldian from beyond the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:16.960
Walls and begs Frieda Reiss to use her Founding&nbsp;
Titan ability to save Shiganshina from the Titans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:22.640
that are breaking in. However, succumbing to&nbsp;
the will of Karl Fritz, she refuses to act.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:27.120
Grisha argues that the Eldians within the&nbsp;
Walls should not be killed for crimes their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:32.640
ancestors committed which they are not even&nbsp;
aware of, but his protests fall on deaf ears.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:38.000
Frieda attempts to explain to him that there is&nbsp;
no point in stealing the Founding Titan's power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:43.360
as only the royal family can use it, but Grisha&nbsp;
reveals that he is already aware of this fact;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:49.120
the Attack Titan's inheritors have the ability to&nbsp;
see the memories of the Titan's future inheritors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:54.320
giving them the ability to see the future.
Grisha proclaims that since the royal family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:54.320 --> 00:13:00.880
is bound by Karl Fritz's vow, he will steal the&nbsp;
Founding Titan away from them. However, despite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:06.480
his threats, Grisha is unable to bring himself&nbsp;
to kill the entire Reiss family, horrified at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:12.320
thought of killing children. It is only when Eren,&nbsp;
acting through the timeless paths in the future&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:18.320
year 854, demands he fulfill his duty by reminding&nbsp;
him of his fellow restorationists and his dead&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:24.640
sister Faye that Grisha finally transforms.&nbsp;
Grisha easily beats Frieda in combat and devours&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:30.320
her before going on to slaughter the entire Reiss&nbsp;
family, sparing only Rod Reiss on Eren's orders.&nbsp;

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:36.960
Exiting the chapel, Grisha is left horrified&nbsp;
by his actions. On the verge of hysteria,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:43.200
Grisha demands Eren to tell him if this is what&nbsp;
he wanted. He begins asking aloud why Eren did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:48.000
not show him everything that will come to pass&nbsp;
and, due to them living next to the Wall, hopes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:54.240
that Carla is safe and was able to get away; he&nbsp;
asks himself again if this was the only way before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:54.240 --> 00:14:00.480
realizing that Zeke's future self is also visiting&nbsp;
him through the paths. Grisha tells his eldest son&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:05.600
that only Eren's plan will succeed, but laments&nbsp;
that Eren's plan will lead to "ghastly" events.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:11.600
Looking up, he realizes that he can actually&nbsp;
see the future Zeke and embraces him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:17.760
apologizing for being a horrible father and&nbsp;
begging for him to find a way to stop Eren's plan.&nbsp;

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:24.000
Traveling to Trost District, Grisha locates Keith&nbsp;
Shadis and enlists his help in searching for his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:30.320
family among the refugees. Upon finding Eren, the&nbsp;
two men learn that Carla has been devoured by a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:35.840
Titan. Grisha is devastated and, thinking back&nbsp;
to his interaction with Eren at the Reiss chapel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:42.320
realizes why he did not reveal what happened.&nbsp;
Accepting that his successor is indeed Eren,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:46.960
Grisha merely tells him that he must avenge&nbsp;
his mother and takes Eren into the woods.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:52.080
When Keith tries to stop him, arguing that&nbsp;
Grisha should not put such a burden on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:57.040
boy's shoulders as he might not be gifted like&nbsp;
Grisha, Grisha simply explains that the fact&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:01.840
that Eren is his son makes him qualified&nbsp;
and orders Keith not to get involved.&nbsp;

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:08.640
In the forest, he entrusts Eren with the key to&nbsp;
his basement and injects him with a Titan serum,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:14.320
explaining to Eren that their memories will&nbsp;
teach him how to use the ability. Grisha is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:19.680
immediately devoured by Eren, transferring both&nbsp;
the Founding Titan and Attack Titan to him.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:26.320
Thank you guys so much for watching&nbsp;
this video, it really means a lot to us.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:31.760
We will see you guys very soon&nbsp;
in one of our next videos!

